              "content": "OpenAI Realtime over WebRTC is not a detail behind the orb. The handshake has four steps and a visible cost, turn-taking has a default the walkie gesture argues with, and two of its hardest properties are invisible at runtime — which makes them a UI problem, not a backend one.",
