        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "lAhMg",
          "name": "Spec delta",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xJF72",
              "name": "Caption",
              "fill": "$lt-slate",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 840,
              "content": "What this does to the decided architecture. Two of the three arguments that killed the agent-router are still binding — they are not refuted here, they are contained. The containment is the design.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "QcAJr",
              "name": "Rows",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 14,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "H9iHd",
                  "name": "retired",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "I02eC",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "stroke": "$glow-blue",
                      "strokeWidth": {
                        "left": 3
                      },
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 8,
                      "padding": [
                        2,
                        0,
                        8,
                        16
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "d08Zw3",
                          "name": "Chip row",
                          "gap": 8,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "KB0mS",
                              "name": "Chip",
                              "cornerRadius": "$r-pill",
                              "stroke": "$glow-blue",
                              "strokeWidth": 1,
                              "padding": [
                                3,
                                9
                              ],
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "kiyLV",
                                  "name": "L",
                                  "fill": "$glow-blue",
                                  "content": "retired",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 0.5
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "lz6v7",
                          "name": "Q",
                          "fill": "$lt-slate",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "“The router was justified by the belief that switching a realtime session between workspaces is hard. That belief is false — it is one session.update.”",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ihARD",
                          "name": "A",
                          "fill": "$lt-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "The orchestrator is not there to route. Workspace switching stays a session.update on the fast path. Its justification is judgement, which is a different claim and has to carry itself.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "FzVlA",
                  "name": "binding",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "W3Jlt",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "stroke": "$lt-amber",
                      "strokeWidth": {
                        "left": 3
                      },
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 8,
                      "padding": [
                        2,
                        0,
                        8,
                        16
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "h5OAD7",
                          "name": "Chip row",
                          "gap": 8,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "B7mmR",
                              "name": "Chip",
                              "cornerRadius": "$r-pill",
                              "stroke": "$lt-amber",
                              "strokeWidth": 1,
                              "padding": [
                                3,
                                9
                              ],
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "HXjed",
                                  "name": "L",
                                  "fill": "$lt-amber",
                                  "content": "still binding",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 0.5
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "UccbW",
                          "name": "Q",
                          "fill": "$lt-slate",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "“A single Claude session serializes every workspace behind one turn chain, so an urgent ask queues behind a ten-minute turn.”",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ry5UV",
                          "name": "A",
                          "fill": "$lt-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Contained by never putting it on the critical path. What is blocked, read me the last turn, and every ask answer are served from Postgres in under two seconds. The moment the orchestrator is what answers those, this argument kills the design a second time.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "HQ5Yu",
                  "name": "binding",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "M0ipSF",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "stroke": "$lt-amber",
                      "strokeWidth": {
                        "left": 3
                      },
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 8,
                      "padding": [
                        2,
                        0,
                        8,
                        16
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "a9pBMp",
                          "name": "Chip row",
                          "gap": 8,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "QOD9C",
                              "name": "Chip",
                              "cornerRadius": "$r-pill",
                              "stroke": "$lt-amber",
                              "strokeWidth": 1,
                              "padding": [
                                3,
                                9
                              ],
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "kwnUn",
                                  "name": "L",
                                  "fill": "$lt-amber",
                                  "content": "still binding",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 0.5
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "p5UP3",
                          "name": "Q",
                          "fill": "$lt-slate",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "“Compaction silently destroys ticket-to-workspace bindings, producing readbacks that are fluent, confident and about the wrong repository.”",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "KRTsT",
                          "name": "A",
                          "fill": "$lt-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Contained by giving it nothing authoritative to lose. Bindings live in the store; the orchestrator reads them like any other client; the thread is a projection, never the record. It is free to compact.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "MRaEG",
                  "name": "ext",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "t7mNAm",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "stroke": "$lt-green",
                      "strokeWidth": {
                        "left": 3
                      },
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 8,
                      "padding": [
                        2,
                        0,
                        8,
                        16
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "G3CHK",
                          "name": "Chip row",
                          "gap": 8,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "b5fsUb",
                              "name": "Chip",
                              "cornerRadius": "$r-pill",
                              "stroke": "$lt-green",
                              "strokeWidth": 1,
                              "padding": [
                                3,
                                9
                              ],
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "Wag4B",
                                  "name": "L",
                                  "fill": "$lt-green",
                                  "content": "extends",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 0.5
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "U5atj",
                          "name": "Q",
                          "fill": "$lt-slate",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "“An ask is structured data — never free text. The service must be structurally unable to originate a workspace call from a worker-supplied string.”",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ontWQ",
                          "name": "A",
                          "fill": "$lt-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Extended to the orchestrator. It cannot post free text into a session either: a dispatch is a typed proposal, checked against the host allowlist, shown on screen, and sent only when you say so.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "jEM3h",
                  "name": "gain",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "Mtm8g",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "stroke": "$lt-green",
                      "strokeWidth": {
                        "left": 3
                      },
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 8,
                      "padding": [
                        2,
                        0,
                        8,
                        16
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "QknOJ",
                          "name": "Chip row",
                          "gap": 8,
                          "alignItems": "center",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "GvQg5",
                              "name": "Chip",
                              "cornerRadius": "$r-pill",
                              "stroke": "$lt-green",
                              "strokeWidth": 1,
                              "padding": [
                                3,
                                9
                              ],
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "WX3NF",
                                  "name": "L",
                                  "fill": "$lt-green",
                                  "content": "gained",
                                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                                  "fontSize": 10,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                                  "letterSpacing": 0.5
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "GbIZk",
                          "name": "Q",
                          "fill": "$lt-slate",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "“Voice replaces a reviewable, logged, textual approval with an ephemeral acoustic one, and leaves no audit artifact.”",
                          "lineHeight": 1.55,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "MWBxO",
                          "name": "A",
                          "fill": "$lt-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Weakened, on purpose. Every spoken exchange writes to the thread, so discussion becomes reviewable after the fact. That is what lets walkie widen from triage into thinking. It does not make voice authoritative — earshot is still authentication, and consequential approval still happens on a screen.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "$font",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Z4adj",
          "name": "Altitude",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 18,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "F6AyM0",
              "name": "Caption",
              "fill": "$lt-slate",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 840,
              "content": "The same orb at four altitudes. What surrounds it says who you are talking to, so a request can never be aimed at the wrong level by accident — and the chrome follows: workspace chips appear at session altitude, orbiting sessions replace them at orchestrator altitude.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
