          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Corrected",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "letterSpacing": -0.2
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "yLdKB",
          "name": "Rule Corrected",
          "fill": "$lt-tidepool",
          "width": 860,
          "height": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m32cV",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“Running state wears the Undertow, not a colored border.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PpaDe",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "The coloured left rule came off all sixteen rows across the document. The halo carries running on its own, which is what it was for.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oYJ57",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“Needing you is a gate, not a failure — mark halts in accent-blue, never red.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m0EX3u",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "The consequential ask went from amber to tidepool. Amber is now reserved for a genuine fault — degraded audio — and never for something waiting on you.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "r1bTvl",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“The branch is the receipt. Never fake progress percentages.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "M2i1l",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "Evidence rows carry run/mut-8821, the diffstat, and the judge verdict instead of prose. The lifecycle rail is five named stages, not a bar that fills.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S1PCO",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“The look is the transaction — what changed · what it decided · what it asks.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ry5Tz",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "Built as App · The look. It was the primitive walkie was missing, and it is also exactly the shape a voice readback needs, which is why walkie can speak it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ROWSF",
          "name": "H Already aligned",
          "fill": "$lt-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Already aligned",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "letterSpacing": -0.2
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "rgdFE",
          "name": "Rule Already aligned",
          "fill": "$glow-blue",
          "width": 860,
          "height": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QoWj7",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“Chat is a projection. A session renders the work; it never owns it.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Zy5UG",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "Arrived at independently last turn, from the truncation constraint. Same conclusion, different route: the thread is a projection of the store, never the record.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "CBe62",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“The orchestrator is an agent — presence in the chrome, a session you can open, a wake log. Never a settings page.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gBr1G",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "The Judgement plane, addressable from the switcher, with Standing on Home. No settings screen anywhere in the app.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lCAAj",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“Calm is load-bearing. Live signals breathe, they don't spin for attention.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wEElK",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "The Undertow breathes. The connect ring is four discrete handshake steps, not a spinner — it reports position in a real sequence.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TTUTO",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“The gate is yours. No loop can auto-Done. Approving is the one human verb.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "T0ZNF9",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "Approve and Send back are the only controls on the look, and anything irreversible leaves the call for a screen.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "CfiNr",
          "name": "H Still divergent",
          "fill": "$lt-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Still divergent",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "letterSpacing": -0.2
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "uRvlZ",
          "name": "Rule Still divergent",
          "fill": "$lt-amber",
          "width": 860,
          "height": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tHkP4",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“Tight scale: 12 / 14 / 16 / 18 / 22 / 24 / 28. Nothing else.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Axgh7",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "walkie.pen runs 11 / 13 / 15 / 17 throughout and pre-dates this work. Aligning it is a document-wide sweep and a decision, not a tidy-up. Flagged, not done.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rhNPo",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“Setting a schedule is a sentence.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bQwj6",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "Standing routines show on Home with the cause of their last wake, but there is no surface where you create one by saying it. Not built.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "By6zb",
          "name": "Q",
          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "“Glass appears in exactly three places: overlays, popovers, the composer.”",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EXWj4",
          "name": "A",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "walkie uses it for the orb dock and the push notification. Both are defensible — the dock is the composer — but the dramatic halo should be the dock's alone, and it currently is not.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "K18ra",
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 22150,
      "name": "Client capability note",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 120,
      "content": "Superseded. v1 is now a native Swift client on the tailnet, not an installed PWA — so waking into a call is available from the start, and the Expo/PushToTalk step is gone. What replaces this note is the topology board below: the cloud half is retired and Genesis runs on the host."
    },
