          "id": "RNvSU",
          "name": "V",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The badge reads contained and a receipt proves it: no merge, no push, no delete, reverts in one command. Voice may approve, and the note says why — the host agent proved containment, not the summary.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "psPck",
          "name": "K",
          "fill": "$lt-mist",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "B2 · APP · LOOK · NEEDS A SCREEN",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yJsa3",
          "name": "V",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Same layout, opposite flag. touches main, an amber receipt saying no single command undoes this, and voice demoted to navigation: say open it, and it brings the screen up. It never presses the button.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "npsIl",
          "name": "K",
          "fill": "$lt-mist",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "WHY NOT JUST REMOVE VOICE APPROVAL",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ueGuX",
          "name": "V",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Because contained runs are most of the volume, and losing them makes walkie a notifier. This keeps the security property whole: a stranger's yes still reaches nothing that matters, because contained is machine-proven and excludes every action the doc names.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ASTve",
          "name": "K",
          "fill": "$lt-mist",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "THE CONDITION",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rqHD1",
          "name": "V",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Containment is computed by the host agent from the run's diff and target. If that cannot be done reliably, fall back to B2 for everything. Never let the model declare its own work safe.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MuAPU",
          "name": "H",
          "fill": "$lt-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "C · which plane answered",
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "letterSpacing": -0.2
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "id": "aVsuu",
          "name": "Rule",
          "fill": "$glow-blue",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rqkex",
          "name": "K",
          "fill": "$lt-mist",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "C1 · THE STORE ANSWERED",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "uHG2G",
          "name": "V",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Bare orb, no orbit, a light chip reading from the store · 41ms. A fact, delivered flat, with nothing woken to produce it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BNMIg",
          "name": "K",
          "fill": "$lt-mist",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "C2 · ESCALATED",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mfKgk",
          "name": "V",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The orbit appears as judgement engages — the sessions gather around the orb. Ink chip, orchestrator · thinking, 8s, and Just the facts as the way back down.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "io4Qx",
          "name": "K",
          "fill": "$lt-mist",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "WHY IT MATTERS",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.5
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "joI0A",
          "name": "V",
          "fill": "$lt-muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A two-second fact and a considered opinion must never arrive in the same voice with the same confidence. This is also what keeps the orchestrator off the critical path in practice rather than only on the diagram.",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
