          "fill": "$lt-slate",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "Not a quieter Undertow — its sibling. Same water, same material, but the flow has stopped: the orbit holds at its last angle, the tide flattens into a level line, and the pools settle either side of it. Water in motion has weather. Water at rest has a surface. That difference is the whole signal.",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "$font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
