        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "s2tbn",
          "name": "Motion",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rfaiO",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "$lt-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "What moves, and how little",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": -0.2
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "YcXpZ",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$lt-tidepool",
              "width": 860,
              "height": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "IgiZk",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "ORBIT",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "NYwd5",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "Stopped. It holds the angle it stopped at, at half opacity — the current's last known position. The Undertow's turns continuously over 9s.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BMyJO",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "TIDE",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "x6nNu8",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "No travel. A level line with about one percent of surface tension over 6s. The Undertow's band rises counter-phase over 3.4s.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sk9cA",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "POOLS",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "PmKkv",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "12s, four percent amplitude. Settled, not dead — the difference between a paused run and a finished one.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pxHrA",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "REDUCED MOTION",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "V7Qgo",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "Unchanged. It is already almost still, which is the point: the accessible frame and the intended frame are the same picture.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "euGtZ",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "COLOUR",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "i662u",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "Tidepool cyan and ice, never the running blue. Hue does the work at a glance; the geometry confirms it on a second look.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "XUQSp",
          "name": "The pair rule",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UPAJj",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "$lt-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The rule that keeps them apart",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": -0.2
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "DE4Yx",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$lt-ink",
              "width": 860,
              "height": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Dy1oB",
              "name": "L",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "One signal family, two states of the same water. The Undertow is motion with no destination — presence, never progress. The Understop is that motion held: the flow reached something it cannot pass without you.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "QzgEc",
              "name": "L",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "Only work that was running can wear the Understop. A queued item never moved, so it gets nothing; a done item released the halo. This is what stops it becoming a decoration for anything mildly important.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c6lPS",
              "name": "L",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "The two never appear on the same surface at the same intensity. On Home the running group breathes and the halted card holds still, so a glance from across the room separates them before a single word is read.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BTPvs",
              "name": "L",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "Both retire the moment their cause does. The Understop clears when you answer — not when the run resumes, because the run resuming is the consequence, not the event.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "R9B8N",
              "name": "Used",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 860,
              "content": "In use: App · Home (needs-you group) · App · Session · seaslug · Orb · needs you · understop · Orb down · undertow",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
