          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 860,
          "content": "Everything above this board is a frozen frame of something that moves. These are the real thing: three rhythms actually running against each other, an SDF that finds the edge of whatever shape it wraps, and uniforms that are the same numbers the runtime already has — volume, intensity, the angle the current stopped at.",
