              "content": "The orb stops being four hand-placed gradients and becomes one uniform. u_volume is the number the Realtime session already hands you — getInputVolume for you, getOutputVolume for walkie — and the petals follow it. Nothing here is drawn twice for a second state.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
