          "content": "The lattice and the halo are now the same shader, so they composite instead of stacking. Inside the sphere, two voices with two different gestures — yours lifts the whole lattice, walkie's lifts only the band it is travelling through. Outside it, the Undertow when work is running and the Understop when it has stopped on you.",
