              "name": "Verdict",
              "fill": "$lt-blue-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 880,
              "content": "My call: bodiless. At hero size the body brings the golf-ball read straight back, and the glow that leaks through is semantically right anyway — the work surrounds the agent, it is not hidden behind it. Keep the body for anywhere the orb sits on a busy or coloured surface, where occlusion stops being optional.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
