        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "wh0fU",
          "name": "Consequences",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 12,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "SLcza",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "$lt-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "What the ambient layer does to the app we built",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": -0.2
            },
            {
              "type": "rectangle",
              "id": "XVSck",
              "name": "R",
              "fill": "$lt-ink",
              "width": 1064,
              "height": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "j8cTk",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "THE DOT IS THE REDUCTION, NOT A SMALLER ORB",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ue9ah",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "Below about 44px the lattice stops being a sphere and becomes noise, so the ambient surfaces do not shrink the orb — they switch to the tidepool dot the design system already specified. Running drifts on the diagonal, needs-you holds one level edge. Both survive at 13px on a black pill, which is the hardest test in the set.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "O4lDb",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "THE ORB SURVIVES IN EXACTLY ONE AMBIENT PLACE",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JcZCS",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "The expanded Island, at 44px with a body. Everywhere smaller it is a dot; everywhere larger you are already in the app. That is a clean rule and it means only one extra asset.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KF5wB",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "HOME LOSES ITS JOB, NOT ITS LAYOUT",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "m77JvN",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "Running and needs-you now live on the Lock Screen and the widget. What is left that is only in the app is Standing, Done, and the threads. Home all quiet is the clearest casualty — the good day is the day the widget is enough and nothing opens.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ORS4q",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "PUSH BECOMES A LIVE ACTIVITY",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "H9u84I",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "The banner was the web's ceiling. A Live Activity persists, updates, and carries a real button. The consequential ask still refuses to be answerable from it — Answer opens the screen with the evidence, exactly as before.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sBikx",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "ONE PROMISE NEEDS REWRITING",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rvqPP",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "App · Microphone says the mic is live only while your thumb is down. Under PushToTalk there is a joined-channel state and a system indicator that this sentence does not describe. That copy is wrong the moment Swift is the direction.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xs4UC",
              "name": "K",
              "fill": "$lt-mist",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "WHAT DOES NOT MOVE",
              "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "exZQz",
              "name": "V",
              "fill": "$lt-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1064,
              "content": "Every screen in row five. Session, both Looks, Ask, Receipts and Access are the deliberate opposite of ambient — they exist because something needed your eyes on a screen with the evidence in front of you. No amount of native surface changes that, and if it ever seems to, that is the security argument eroding rather than the design improving.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
